{
  "derivation" : "Generated on macOS 27.2 with swiftc: print(ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: Date(timeIntervalSince1970: unixSeconds))). Foundation (CFDateFormatter) converts the instant to ICU milliseconds as (t + 978307200) * 1000 + 0.5 and ICU floors, so a fraction >= 0.9995 s rounds up to the next second before the whole-second format. A 35191-value grid around every .0005/.4995/.9995 edge was checked against the Rust port; these vectors are a readable subset. Follow-up of WP-A.11.",
  "function" : "format_scored_at",
  "schema" : "asd-golden/1",
  "source" : "PerVideoScoringEngine.score: ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: scoredAt)",
